# contact_guard refuses a travel queued behind a descent onto the plate
# (Codex P1 on #57).  Exits with an error.  The travel is checked as it
# enters the lookahead, before the descent has run; the guard must wait for
# the descent and decide on the samples after it.  contact_guard.test runs
# the same macro to 0.5 mm and to a touch-and-lift, both allowed.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG contact_guard.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

G28
G90
G1 X50 Y50 Z5 F6000
CONTACT_GUARD_SIMULATE LOAD=0 DURATION=0.5
CONTACT_GUARD_SIMULATE PLATE_Z=0 STIFFNESS=19500000
DESCEND_THEN_TRAVEL Z=-0.02 X=60
